The HiChat SFrame wire protocol uses all 8-bit indices (0..255), hence 256 slots.
The worker allocates a Dart list, so rejecting length 256 is an off-by-one.
Only the validation bound is extended. Key derivation and cryptography are unchanged.
The build script patches a project-local copy and checks the upstream source hash.

